            "id": 126816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>membership</code> değerinin <code>\"gold\"</code> değerine eşit olup olmadığını kontrol eden (kod bloğu olmayan) boş bir <code>if</code> ifadesi ve ardından boş bir <code>else</code> ifadesi kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" membership = \" /><text value=\"&quot;gold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" membership == \" /><text value=\"&quot;gold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else membership != &quot;gold&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>if</code>, ardından <code>membership == \"gold\"</code> ve sonra <code>}</code>, <code>else</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
